# Copy to .env locally. For production, set variables in the host UI:
# - Cloudflare Pages (canonical host): Project → Settings → Environment variables
#   (set for both Production and Preview).
#
# If public mailto: links 404 in SEO tools, turn off Cloudflare "Email Address Obfuscation"
# (Scrape Shield) or use the contact form instead of raw mailto in high-visibility pages.

# Customer.io newsletter / lead capture
# Browser → POST /api/forms → Track Forms API (credentials stay server-side).
#
# What you need:
# 1) Customer.io → Settings → API Credentials → Track API (Site ID + API Key).
# 2) Region: must be eu for the WSS Customer.io workspace (eu.fly.customer.io).
# 3) Form id is an arbitrary string (e.g. wss-newsletter). First submit creates
#    the connection under Integrations → Forms; map fields there if needed.
# 4) Set the secrets below on Cloudflare Pages (Production + Preview).
# 5) Submit a test from the live site; confirm the person appears in Customer.io.
#
# CUSTOMER_IO_SITE_ID=xxxx
# CUSTOMER_IO_TRACK_API_KEY=xxxx
# CUSTOMER_IO_REGION=eu
# CUSTOMER_IO_FORM_ID=wss-newsletter
# PUBLIC_CUSTOMER_IO_FORM_ID=wss-newsletter

# Podcast guest applications (/api/podcast-guest on Cloudflare Pages)
# Applications are always emailed to daniel@wescalestartups.com.
# Optional delivery backends (first match wins):
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxx
# GUEST_APPLICATION_FROM=We Scale Startups <forms@your-verified-domain.com>
# GUEST_APPLICATION_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/...
# If Resend/webhook are unset, FormSubmit.co emails daniel@wescalestartups.com
# (first live submit sends an activation link). Disable with:
# GUEST_APPLICATION_DISABLE_FORMSUBMIT=1
